== stock dispatch in MLX (read in source, backend/metal/quantized.cpp)
gather_qmm -> gather_qmm_rhs when M == 1, B >= 16, sorted indices, B / E >= 4; else gather_qmv.
gather_qmm_rhs uses the NAX kernel when is_nax_available() (macOS >= 26.2, GPU generation >= 17, >= 18 for 'p').
Decode load at B = 32 (T*k/E): Qwen3 2, Gemma-4 2, GLM 2, DeepSeek 3, LFM2.5 4.
Nothing was measured on any chip other than the M4 Pro.
